<title>USA: AVX Corp CEO Rosen named chairman.</title>
<headline>AVX Corp CEO Rosen named chairman.</headline>
<dateline>MYRTLE BEACH, S.C. 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>AVX Corp said Tuesday that Benedict Rosen had been named chairman of the board, succeeding Kuzuo Inamori.</p>
<p>Rosen will continue as the chief executive officer.</p>
<p>AVX manufactures and supplies passive electronic components and related products.</p>
</text>
